==Rarity==
{{Main|Impling#Spawn_mechanics}}
On the Gielinor surface, eclectic implings have a 10/100 chance to appear out of a low-tier invisible spawn, as well as a 37/100 chance of appearing out of a mid-tier invisible spawn. The same holds for the invisible spawns present in Puro-Puro. In addition to these however, there are also a number of fixed spawns in Puro-Puro that will always yield an eclectic impling. 

For a more detailed breakdown of impling spawn mechanics, see the main article.

